{"release":{"id":386333683,"tag":"v1.13.8","author":"csukuangfj","name":"v1.13.8","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-09-10T13:52:45Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-10T14:00:23Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* Fix releasing by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3911\r\n* Fix data race on shared PRNG in FunASR-Nano and Qwen3-ASR offline recognizers by @fra-shipper in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3912\r\n* Support building within a termux terminal on Android devices by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3916\r\n* Support sherpa-onnx with Python in Termux on Android by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3922\r\n* Fix Go API tests in CI for Windows by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3932\r\n* Add Kokoro v1.0 em_santa voice by @kroryan in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3928\r\n* Add Nabra-82M Arabic TTS conversion scripts for Kokoro runtime by @marwanelamami in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3898\r\n* Fix Cohere Transcribe hallucinating sentences on silent audio by @kyo-zzz in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3924\r\n* Fix Moonshine v2 hallucinating text on silent audio by @kyo-zzz in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3923\r\n* Fix FunASR-Nano hallucinating text on silent audio by @kyo-zzz in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3921\r\n* Fix Canary empty transcript when the first decoded token is eos by @kyo-zzz in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3920\r\n* Add Intel NPU support through OpenVINO by @jacob-vincent-mink in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3910\r\n* Add per-segment confidence computation for OfflineSpeakerDiarization by @matiaslin in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3881\r\n* Upload the nabra 82M Arabic TTS int8 model by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3933\r\n* Add Go API for Windows arm64 by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3934\r\n* Add Go bindings for OfflineSpeakerDiarization confidence computation by @matiaslin in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3936\r\n* fix(nemo/qnn/parakeet-ctc): wrapper.py raises NameError on undefined `feat_dim` by @Anai-Guo in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3937\r\n* Fix CI tests by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3940\r\n* Update onnxruntime to v1.28.2 by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3935\r\n* Add robust download retry logic to all test scripts by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3941\r\n* Support running Rust API examples on termux within Android by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3942\r\n* Add confidence computation support for speaker diarization to JNI. by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3943\r\n* fix(python-tests): UnboundLocalError instead of the intended ValueError in test_fast_clustering by @Anai-Guo in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3944\r\n* Test using uv to install sherpa-onnx by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3946\r\n* Release v1.13.8 by @csukuangfj in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3945\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @kroryan made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3928\r\n* @marwanelamami made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3898\r\n* @kyo-zzz made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3924\r\n* @jacob-vincent-mink made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3910\r\n* @Anai-Guo made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3937\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/compare/v1.13.7...v1.13.8","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix releasing by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3911\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3911</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix data race on shared PRNG in FunASR-Nano and Qwen3-ASR offline recognizers by @fra-shipper in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3912\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3912</a>\n</li>\n<li>Support building within a termux terminal on Android devices by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3916\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3916</a>\n</li>\n<li>Support sherpa-onnx with Python in Termux on Android by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3922\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3922</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix Go API tests in CI for Windows by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3932\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3932</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add Kokoro v1.0 em_santa voice by @kroryan in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3928\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3928</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add Nabra-82M Arabic TTS conversion scripts for Kokoro runtime by @marwanelamami in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3898\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3898</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix Cohere Transcribe hallucinating sentences on silent audio by @kyo-zzz in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3924\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3924</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix Moonshine v2 hallucinating text on silent audio by @kyo-zzz in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3923\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3923</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix FunASR-Nano hallucinating text on silent audio by @kyo-zzz in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3921\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3921</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix Canary empty transcript when the first decoded token is eos by @kyo-zzz in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3920\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3920</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add Intel NPU support through OpenVINO by @jacob-vincent-mink in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3910\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3910</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add per-segment confidence computation for OfflineSpeakerDiarization by @matiaslin in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3881\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3881</a>\n</li>\n<li>Upload the nabra 82M Arabic TTS int8 model by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3933\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3933</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add Go API for Windows arm64 by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3934\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3934</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add Go bindings for OfflineSpeakerDiarization confidence computation by @matiaslin in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3936\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3936</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix(nemo/qnn/parakeet-ctc): wrapper.py raises NameError on undefined <code>feat_dim</code> by @Anai-Guo in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3937\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3937</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix CI tests by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3940\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3940</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update onnxruntime to v1.28.2 by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3935\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3935</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add robust download retry logic to all test scripts by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3941\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3941</a>\n</li>\n<li>Support running Rust API examples on termux within Android by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3942\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3942</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add confidence computation support for speaker diarization to JNI. by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3943\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3943</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix(python-tests): UnboundLocalError instead of the intended ValueError in test_fast_clustering by @Anai-Guo in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3944\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3944</a>\n</li>\n<li>Test using uv to install sherpa-onnx by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3946\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3946</a>\n</li>\n<li>Release v1.13.8 by @csukuangfj in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3945\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3945</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@kroryan made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3928\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3928</a>\n</li>\n<li>@marwanelamami made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3898\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3898</a>\n</li>\n<li>@kyo-zzz made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3924\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3924</a>\n</li>\n<li>@jacob-vincent-mink made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3910\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/pull/3910</a>\n</li>\n<li>@Anai-Guo made their first contribution in <a href=